["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/AuthenticationProtocolType/tls", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Transport Layer Security, or TLS, is a widely adopted security protocol designed to facilitate privacy and data security for communications over the Internet.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
