["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/useSensitivePersonalInformation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Records if sensitive personal information is used during model training or\ncould be used during the inference.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
