["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/buildStartTime", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "**NOTE:**\nThis property is deprecated and only included for backward compatibility.\nNew documents should use\n/Core/startTime\ninstead.\n\nbuildStartTime is the time at which a build is triggered.\n\nThe builder typically records this value.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/CdxPropertiesExtension", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This extension provides a more structured extension using a name-value\napproach.\n\nUnlike key-value stores, properties in CdxPropertiesExtension support duplicate names, each\npotentially having different values.\n\nThis is intended to be compatible with the CycloneDX property properties.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
