["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/finetunedOn", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The from Element has been finetuned on the to Element(s).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
