["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/Assumption", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An assumption element is a distinct unit that defines a design constraint.\nThis constraint is imposed by the intended design, the requirement context, or the operational context.\nIt ensures the item operates correctly within a system context.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
