["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ReproduceAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Reproduction involves the act of replicating or reproducing a product. This includes producing new products related to husbandry, agriculture, and fishing.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each ReproduceAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasInput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N6f6d11feed3a41f8a26345f9857e1ca3", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/provider", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The Agent that provides a SoftwareService to one or more consumers.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Conducting controlled tests, experiments or simulations to verify that specific requirements regarding performance, functionality, robustness, etc. are met.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/hashValue", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A hashValue is the result of applying a hash algorithm to an Element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
