["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/InspectionAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An inspection action refers to a specific activity or set of activities performed during an inspection to examine, verify, or evaluate an item, process, or system. These actions are typically intended to identify whether the subject being inspected meets required standards, regulations, or specifications.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
