["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/name", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This field identifies the name of an Element as designated by the creator.\n\nThe name of an Element is an important convention and easier to refer to than\nthe URI.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Custody refers to the responsibility, control, and safekeeping of an asset, person, or legal entity. It involves both physical possession and legal authority over something or someone.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
