["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/plannedTransportRoutes", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A transport route is the planned path taken by people, products, goods, data or resources. Transport routes vary by product type, safety requirements, business constraints or other factors.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
