["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Ownership refers to the legal right to control, manage, and benefit from an asset, resource, or responsibility. It establishes authority, accountability, and entitlements over something, whether it's property, a business, intellectual property, or responsibilities.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
