["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/BulkHardware", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Products or commodities produced as a bulk unit are called bulk products. Commodities are often sold in bulk based on a batch or bulk ID number associated with the bulk unit.\nBulk units defined in the QUDT Units standards.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
